    'Hygiene + Stale': 'Hijyen + Eski',
    'Score increases with risk. Each category is normalized by its threshold and combined with equal category weights.': 'Skor riskle birlikte artar. Her kategori kendi e\u015fi\u011fine g\u00f6re normalle\u015ftirilir ve e\u015fit a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klarla birle\u015ftirilir.',
    'No skipped/unreachable control execution detected.': 'Atlanm\u0131\u015f veya eri\u015filemeyen kontrol tespit edilmedi.',
    'Yes': 'Evet',
    'No': 'Hay\u0131r',
    'Never': 'Hi\u00e7',
    'Enable SID filtering, disable unnecessary TGT delegation, and review selective authentication.': 'SID filtrelemeyi etkinle\u015ftirin, gereksiz TGT delegasyonunu devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n ve se\u00e7ici kimlik do\u011frulamay\u0131 g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin.',
    'Review and remove unnecessary SIDHistory values, especially after migration projects.': 'Gereksiz SIDHistory de\u011ferlerini, \u00f6zellikle migrasyon projeleri sonras\u0131nda, g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin ve kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Disable DONT_REQ_PREAUTH on regular users and enforce strong password policy.': 'S\u0131radan kullan\u0131c\u0131larda DONT_REQ_PREAUTH bayra\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n ve g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc parola politikas\u0131 uygulay\u0131n.',
    'Password not required': 'Parola zorunlu de\u011fil',
    'Clear the PASSWD_NOTREQD flag on affected accounts and enforce the domain minimum password length; prioritize privileged and enabled accounts.': 'Etkilenen hesaplardaki PASSWD_NOTREQD bayra\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n ve domain minimum parola uzunlu\u011funu zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131n; ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 ve etkin hesaplar\u0131 \u00f6nceliklendirin.',
    'No enabled user with PasswordNotRequired': 'PasswordNotRequired bayrakl\u0131 etkin kullan\u0131c\u0131 yok',
    'PASSWD_NOTREQD set - Enabled': 'PASSWD_NOTREQD ayarl\u0131 - Etkin',
    'PASSWD_NOTREQD set - Disabled': 'PASSWD_NOTREQD ayarl\u0131 - Devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131',
    'PASSWD_NOTREQD set - Enabled (privileged/adminCount=1)': 'PASSWD_NOTREQD ayarl\u0131 - Etkin (ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131/adminCount=1)',
    'Rotate krbtgt password in a controlled 2-step process and document rotation cadence.': 'krbtgt parolas\u0131n\u0131 kontroll\u00fc 2 ad\u0131ml\u0131 s\u00fcre\u00e7le yenileyin ve rotasyon takvimini belgeleyin.',
    'Move SPNs to gMSA/service accounts and keep privileged users free from SPN when possible.': 'SPN\'leri gMSA/servis hesaplar\u0131na ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131n; ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 m\u00fcmk\u00fcn oldu\u011funda SPN\'den ar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Remove unconstrained delegation and use constrained delegation or gMSA patterns.': 'K\u0131s\u0131ts\u0131z delegasyonu kald\u0131r\u0131n; yerine k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131 delegasyon veya gMSA kullan\u0131n.',
    'Review all constrained delegation paths and restrict to necessary SPNs only.': 'T\u00fcm k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131 delegasyon yollar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin ve yaln\u0131zca gerekli SPN\'lerle s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131n.',
    'Review and minimize msDS-AllowedToActOnBehalfOfOtherIdentity on servers and especially DC-adjacent assets.': 'Sunucularda ve DC yak\u0131n\u0131 varl\u0131klarda msDS-AllowedToActOnBehalfOfOtherIdentity de\u011ferini g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin ve minimize edin.',
    'Remove GPP password entries and rotate any potentially exposed credentials immediately.': 'GPP parola girdilerini kald\u0131r\u0131n ve if\u015fa olmu\u015f olabilecek kimlik bilgilerini hemen yenileyin.',
    'Track Legacy LAPS and Windows LAPS v2 separately and enforce endpoint coverage with expiration monitoring.': 'Legacy LAPS ve Windows LAPS v2\'yi ayr\u0131 izleyin; son tarih takibiyle u\u00e7 nokta kapsam\u0131n\u0131 zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131n.',
    'Prefer AES encryption types and remove DES/legacy settings from service accounts.': 'AES \u015fifreleme tiplerini tercih edin ve servis hesaplar\u0131ndan DES/eski \u015fifreleme ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Remove password-never-expires from regular accounts and apply exception process only where required.': 'S\u0131radan hesaplardan \u015fifrenin s\u00fcresi dolmaz ayar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n; yaln\u0131zca zorunlu durumlarda istisna s\u00fcreci uygulay\u0131n.',
    'Review adminCount=1 accounts outside privileged groups and fix ACL inheritance where applicable.': 'Ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 gruplar d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki adminCount=1 hesaplar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin ve uygun yerlerde ACL kal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 d\u00fczeltin.',
    'Set AccountNotDelegated for privileged accounts unless explicitly required.': 'A\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a gerekmedik\u00e7e ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 hesaplar i\u00e7in AccountNotDelegated ayar\u0131n\u0131 yap\u0131n.',
    'Review privileged users not in Protected Users and add compatible accounts.': 'Protected Users grubunda olmayan ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin ve uyumlu hesaplar\u0131 gruba ekleyin.',
    'Keep Schema Admins empty by default and use JIT elevation for schema operations.': 'Schema Admins grubunu varsay\u0131lan olarak bo\u015f tutun; \u015fema i\u015flemleri i\u00e7in JIT yetki y\u00fckseltmesi kullan\u0131n.',
    'Enable AD Recycle Bin after change control and backup validation.': 'De\u011fi\u015fiklik onay\u0131 ve yedek do\u011frulamas\u0131n\u0131n ard\u0131ndan AD Geri D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm Kutusu\'nu etkinle\u015ftirin.',
    'Set machine account quota to 0 when possible and use controlled join workflows.': 'M\u00fcmk\u00fcn oldu\u011funda makine hesab\u0131 kotas\u0131n\u0131 0\'a ayarlay\u0131n ve kontroll\u00fc domain kat\u0131l\u0131m s\u00fcre\u00e7leri kullan\u0131n.',
    'Increase minimum password length (preferably 12+) and apply stronger fine-grained policies where needed.': 'Minimum parola uzunlu\u011funu art\u0131r\u0131n (tercihen 12+) ve gereken yerlerde daha g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 politikalar uygulay\u0131n.',
    'Limit usage of builtin admin and prefer dedicated tiered admin accounts.': 'Yerle\u015fik y\u00f6netici kullan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131n ve adanm\u0131\u015f katmanl\u0131 y\u00f6netici hesaplar\u0131n\u0131 tercih edin.',
    'Run and monitor regular system state backups for domain controllers.': 'Domain controller\'lar i\u00e7in d\u00fczenli sistem durumu yedekleri al\u0131n ve izleyin.',
    'Disable print spooler service on domain controllers.': 'Domain controller\'larda yazd\u0131rma biriktiricisi servisini devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n.',
    'Harden RPC coercion paths and reduce exposed printer-related interfaces.': 'RPC zorlama yollar\u0131n\u0131 sertle\u015ftirin ve yaz\u0131c\u0131yla ilgili a\u00e7\u0131k aray\u00fczleri azalt\u0131n.',
    'Enable and verify advanced audit policy baseline on all domain controllers.': 'T\u00fcm domain controller\'larda geli\u015fmi\u015f denetim ilkesi temelini etkinle\u015ftirin ve do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'Set LmCompatibilityLevel to 5 on DCs and disable legacy NTLM protocols.': 'DC\'lerde LmCompatibilityLevel de\u011ferini 5\'e ayarlay\u0131n ve eski NTLM protokollerini devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n.',
    'Set LDAPServerIntegrity to enforce LDAP signing on domain controllers.': 'Domain controller\'larda LDAP imzalamay\u0131 zorunlu k\u0131lmak i\u00e7in LDAPServerIntegrity\'yi ayarlay\u0131n.',
    'Set LdapEnforceChannelBinding to a protected mode and validate client compatibility.': 'LdapEnforceChannelBinding\'i korumal\u0131 moda ayarlay\u0131n ve istemci uyumlulu\u011funu do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'Review delegated operator groups and remove non-essential members and nested control paths.': 'Yetki devredilmi\u015f operat\u00f6r gruplar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin; gereksiz \u00fcyeleri ve i\u00e7 i\u00e7e denetim yollar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Restrict privileged account logons to tiered admin workstations and domain controllers only.': 'Ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 hesap oturumlar\u0131n\u0131 yaln\u0131zca katmanl\u0131 y\u00f6netim i\u015f istasyonlar\u0131 ve domain controller\'larla s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131n.',
    'Restrict DS replication rights to built-in replication principals and remove delegated DCSync paths.': 'DS replikasyon haklar\u0131n\u0131 yerle\u015fik replikasyon hesaplar\u0131yla s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131n ve delege edilmi\u015f DCSync yollar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Migrate service identities to gMSA, rotate stale passwords, and remove unnecessary SPNs.': 'Servis kimliklerini gMSA\'ya ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131n, eski parolalar\u0131 yenileyin ve gereksiz SPN\'leri kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Remove non-essential GenericAll/GenericWrite/WriteDacl/WriteOwner ACEs from Tier-0 objects.': 'Tier-0 nesnelerden gerekli olmayan GenericAll/GenericWrite/WriteDacl/WriteOwner yetkilerini kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Identify NTLMv1 clients, enforce NTLM hardening and eliminate legacy authentication paths.': 'NTLMv1 istemcilerini tespit edin, NTLM sertle\u015ftirmesini zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131n ve eski kimlik do\u011frulama yollar\u0131n\u0131 kapat\u0131n.',
    'Separate Tier-0 and Tier-1 administration paths and enforce PAW usage for privileged identities.': 'Tier-0 ve Tier-1 y\u00f6netim yollar\u0131n\u0131 birbirinden ay\u0131r\u0131n ve ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 kimlikler i\u00e7in PAW kullan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131n.',
    'Review WHfB key credentials and restrict write permissions to msDS-KeyCredentialLink.': 'WHfB anahtar kimlik bilgilerini g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin ve msDS-KeyCredentialLink \u00fczerindeki yazma izinlerini k\u0131s\u0131tlay\u0131n.',
    'Remove broad identities from Pre-Windows 2000 Compatible Access group.': 'Pre-Windows 2000 Compatible Access grubundan geni\u015f kapsaml\u0131 kimlikleri kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Minimize DnsAdmins membership and enforce secure zone transfer configuration.': 'DnsAdmins \u00fcyeli\u011fini minimumda tutun ve g\u00fcvenli b\u00f6lge aktar\u0131m yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131n\u0131 zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131n.',
    'Disable or clean stale SPN accounts and migrate service identities to managed models.': 'Eski SPN hesaplar\u0131n\u0131 devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n veya temizleyin; servis kimliklerini y\u00f6netilen modellere ta\u015f\u0131y\u0131n.',
    'Increase gMSA usage and reduce password-managed service accounts.': 'gMSA kullan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131n ve elle parola y\u00f6netilen servis hesaplar\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131n.',
    'Use DFS-R only, remove credential residues from SYSVOL/NETLOGON, and monitor script shares.': 'Yaln\u0131zca DFS-R kullan\u0131n; SYSVOL/NETLOGON\'dan kimlik bilgisi kal\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n ve betik payla\u015f\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 izleyin.',
    'Investigate off-hours privileged activity and enforce just-in-time administrative sessions.': 'Mesai d\u0131\u015f\u0131 ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 etkinlikleri ara\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n ve anl\u0131k (JIT) y\u00f6netimsel oturum zorunlulu\u011fu uygulay\u0131n.',
    'Apply stricter fine-grained password policies to privileged identities.': 'Ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 kimliklere daha kat\u0131 ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 parola politikalar\u0131 uygulay\u0131n.',
    'Enforce SMB signing, LDAP signing and channel binding across all domain controllers.': 'T\u00fcm domain controller\'larda SMB imzalama, LDAP imzalama ve kanal ba\u011flamas\u0131n\u0131 zorunlu k\u0131l\u0131n.',
    'Set secure GPO ownership and remove broad principals from GPO owner chain.': 'G\u00fcvenli GPO sahipli\u011fini ayarlay\u0131n ve GPO sahibi zincirinden geni\u015f kapsaml\u0131 hesaplar\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Remove unsafe GPO edit and modify-security rights from non-admin principals.': 'Y\u00f6netici olmayan hesaplardan g\u00fcvensiz GPO d\u00fczenleme ve g\u00fcvenlik de\u011fi\u015ftirme haklar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Clean unlinked/disabled GPOs and reduce policy management noise.': 'Ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131z ve devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 GPO\'lar\u0131 temizleyin; politika y\u00f6netimi karma\u015f\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131n.',
    'Set expected owner principals for Tier-0 computer objects and review delegated ACL changes.': 'Tier-0 bilgisayar nesneleri i\u00e7in beklenen sahip hesaplar\u0131 atay\u0131n ve delege edilmi\u015f ACL de\u011fi\u015fikliklerini g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin.',
    'Limit WinRM/RDP local group membership on domain controllers to approved admins only.': 'Domain controller\'larda WinRM/RDP yerel grup \u00fcyeli\u011fini yaln\u0131zca onayl\u0131 y\u00f6neticilerle s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131n.',
    'Disable CredSSP where not required and prefer Kerberos constrained delegation patterns.': 'Gerekli olmayan yerlerde CredSSP\'yi devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n; Kerberos k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131 delegasyonunu tercih edin.',
    'Disable SMBv1 on all domain controllers immediately \u2014 set SMB1=0 in LanmanServer Parameters and disable the Windows feature.': 'T\u00fcm domain controller\'larda SMBv1\'i hemen devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n \u2014 LanmanServer Parametrelerinde SMB1=0 yap\u0131n ve Windows \u00f6zelli\u011fini kapat\u0131n.',
    'Set UseLogonCredential=0 in HKLM\\...\\WDigest on all DCs \u2014 prevents Mimikatz from extracting cleartext passwords from LSASS.': 'T\u00fcm DC\'lerde HKLM\\...\\WDigest alt\u0131nda UseLogonCredential=0 yap\u0131n \u2014 Mimikatz\'\u0131n LSASS\'tan a\u00e7\u0131k metin \u015fifrelerini \u00e7\u0131karmas\u0131n\u0131 engeller.',
    'Enable RunAsPPL=1 on all DCs to prevent LSASS credential dumping \u2014 requires reboot to activate.': 'T\u00fcm DC\'lerde RunAsPPL=1 etkinle\u015ftirerek LSASS kimlik bilgisi d\u00f6k\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc engelleyin \u2014 aktif olmas\u0131 i\u00e7in yeniden ba\u015flatma gereklidir.',
    'Enable Virtualization-Based Security and Credential Guard on DCs running Windows Server 2016+ to isolate LSASS into a hypervisor-protected container.': 'Windows Server 2016+ \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131ran DC\'lerde Sanalla\u015ft\u0131rma Tabanl\u0131 G\u00fcvenlik ve Credential Guard\'\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirerek LSASS\'\u0131 hiper y\u00f6netici korumal\u0131 bir kapsay\u0131c\u0131da yal\u0131t\u0131n.',
    'Tier0: SMBv1 enabled on DC': 'Tier0: DC\'de SMBv1 Etkin',
    'Tier0: WDigest plaintext credentials': 'Tier0: WDigest A\u00e7\u0131k Metin Kimlik Bilgileri',
    'Tier0: LSA Protection disabled': 'Tier0: LSA Korumas\u0131 Devre D\u0131\u015f\u0131',
    'Tier1: Credential Guard absent': 'Tier1: Credential Guard Yok',
    'No DC with SMBv1 enabled detected': 'SMBv1 etkin DC tespit edilmedi',
    'No DC with WDigest plaintext credentials enabled': 'WDigest a\u00e7\u0131k metin kimlik bilgileri etkin DC tespit edilmedi',
    'LSA Protection (RunAsPPL) enabled on all reachable DCs': 'LSA Korumas\u0131 (RunAsPPL) eri\u015filebilir t\u00fcm DC\'lerde etkin',
    'Credential Guard running on all sampled DCs': '\u00d6rneklenen t\u00fcm DC\'lerde Credential Guard \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor',
    'Disable enrollee supplied subject and tighten authentication template controls.': 'Kay\u0131t yapan\u0131n konu belirlemesini devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n ve kimlik do\u011frulama \u015fablonu denetimlerini s\u0131k\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.',
    'Remove template write/owner/ACL rights from broad principals and enforce PKI least privilege.': 'Geni\u015f kapsaml\u0131 hesaplardan \u015fablon yazma/sahiplik/ACL haklar\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n ve PKI en az ayr\u0131cal\u0131k ilkesini uygulay\u0131n.',
    'Control unavailable: verify certificate template ESC1 conditions manually.': 'Kontrol kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor: sertifika \u015fablonu ESC1 ko\u015fullar\u0131n\u0131 manuel olarak do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'Control unavailable: review template ACL permissions manually.': 'Kontrol kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor: \u015fablon ACL izinlerini manuel olarak g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin.',
    'Disable EDITF_ATTRIBUTESUBJECTALTNAME2 on enterprise CAs unless strictly required and governed.': 'Kesin gereklilik ve y\u00f6netim altyap\u0131s\u0131 yoksa kurumsal CA\'larda EDITF_ATTRIBUTESUBJECTALTNAME2\'yi devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n.',
    'Control unavailable: verify CA EditFlags manually.': 'Kontrol kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor: CA EditFlags de\u011ferini manuel olarak do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'Limit or disable AD CS web enrollment and harden NTLM relay protections on CA web endpoints.': 'AD CS web kayd\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rlay\u0131n veya devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131n; CA web u\u00e7 noktalar\u0131nda NTLM relay korumalar\u0131n\u0131 sertle\u015ftirin.',
    'Control unavailable: validate CA HTTP enrollment exposure manually.': 'Kontrol kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor: CA HTTP kay\u0131t a\u00e7\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 manuel olarak do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'Ensure MSOL_/Sync_ accounts have minimal permissions, verify no DCSync rights are granted, and restrict logon to the AD Connect server only.': 'MSOL_/Sync_ hesaplar\u0131n\u0131n minimum izinlere sahip oldu\u011funu do\u011frulay\u0131n, DCSync hakk\u0131 verilmedi\u011fini kontrol edin ve oturumu yaln\u0131zca AD Connect sunucusuyla k\u0131s\u0131tlay\u0131n.',
    'Raise DFL and FFL to Windows Server 2016+ to enable Protected Users improvements, Kerberos armoring, and deprecate legacy authentication paths.': 'Protected Users iyile\u015ftirmeleri, Kerberos armoring ve eski kimlik do\u011frulama yollar\u0131n\u0131n kapat\u0131lmas\u0131 i\u00e7in DFL ve FFL\'yi Windows Server 2016+ seviyesine y\u00fckseltin.',
    'Review all PSOs and ensure privileged account groups have stricter policies than the default domain policy.': 'T\u00fcm PSO\'lar\u0131 g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irin ve ayr\u0131cal\u0131kl\u0131 hesap gruplar\u0131n\u0131n varsay\u0131lan domain politikas\u0131ndan daha kat\u0131 kurallara sahip oldu\u011funu do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'If Azure AD Connect is deployed, verify all target computers are hybrid-joined and monitor device registration health in Entra portal.': 'Azure AD Connect da\u011f\u0131t\u0131ld\u0131ysa t\u00fcm hedef bilgisayarlar\u0131n hybrid join yap\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frulay\u0131n ve Entra portal\u0131nda cihaz kay\u0131t sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 izleyin.',
    'Quick Remediation Plan': 'H\u0131zl\u0131 \u0130yile\u015ftirme Plan\u0131',
    'Validate and close': 'Do\u011frula ve kapat',
    're-run this report after remediation and confirm Critical/High findings trend downward.': '\u0130yile\u015ftirme sonras\u0131 raporu yeniden \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n ve Kritik/Y\u00fcksek Riskli bulgular\u0131n azald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frulay\u0131n.',
    'No immediate high-pressure category detected. Keep current baseline controls and continue periodic review.': 'Y\u00fcksek bask\u0131l\u0131 kategori tespit edilmedi. Mevcut temel kontrolleri s\u00fcrd\u00fcr\u00fcn ve periyodik g\u00f6zden ge\u00e7irmeye devam edin.',
    'The higher the score, the worse your AD security posture. A score above 70 requires immediate remediation.': 'Skor ne kadar y\u00fcksekse AD g\u00fcvenlik durumu o kadar k\u00f6t\u00fcd\u00fcr. 70 \u00fczeri skor acil iyile\u015ftirme gerektirir.',

